--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Bundled third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

- DOOM engine: doomgeneric (https://github.com/ozkl/doomgeneric), a portable
  port of id Software's DOOM (https://github.com/id-Software/DOOM), compiled to
  WebAssembly. GPL-2.0.

- The WebAssembly build (engine/doom.js, engine/doom.wasm) and the CommonJS
  engine wrapper are derived from pi-doom (https://github.com/badlogic/pi-doom),
  GPL-2.0.

- engine/doom1.wad is the DOOM shareware IWAD ("Knee-Deep in the Dead"),
  © 1993 id Software. It is included unmodified and in whole under id Software's
  shareware distribution terms, which permit free redistribution of the
  unmodified shareware WAD. It may not be modified or repackaged.

DOOM is a trademark of id Software LLC. Claude and Claude Code are trademarks of
Anthropic PBC. This project is an independent, unofficial tool; it is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by id Software, ZeniMax, or Anthropic.
It bundles and redistributes no Anthropic software — the `split` command only
launches the user's own separately-installed Claude Code alongside the game.
